{
  "id": "PSA.71",
  "number": "71",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 71",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "71",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 71"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "71",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En toi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! j'ai mis ma confiance : que je ne sois jamais confus !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dans ta justice, délivre-moi et fais que j'échappe ; incline ton oreille vers moi et sauve-moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sois pour moi un rocher d'habitation, afin que j'y entre continuellement ; tu as donné commandement de me sauver, car tu es mon rocher et mon lieu fort.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! fais-moi échapper de la main du méchant, de la main de l'injuste et de l'oppresseur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car toi tu es mon attente, Seigneur",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! ma confiance dès ma jeunesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je me suis appuyé sur toi dès le ventre ; c'est toi qui m'as tiré hors des",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "entrailles de ma mère : tu es le sujet continuel de ma louange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je suis pour plusieurs comme un prodige ; mais toi, tu es mon fort refuge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma bouche est pleine de ta louange [et] de ta magnificence, tout le jour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne me rejette pas au temps de [ma] vieillesse ; ne m'abandonne pas quand ma force est consumée.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car mes ennemis parlent contre moi, et ceux qui guettent mon âme consultent ensemble,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Disant :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "l'a abandonné ; poursuivez-le et saisissez-le, car il n'y a personne qui le délivre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! ne te tiens pas loin de moi ; mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", hâte-toi de me secourir !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qu'ils soient honteux, qu'ils soient consumés, ceux qui sont ennemis de mon âme ; qu'ils soient couverts d'opprobre et de confusion, ceux qui cherchent mon malheur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais moi, j'attendrai continuellement, et je redirai sans cesse toutes tes louanges.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma bouche racontera tout le jour ta justice [et] ton salut, car je n'en connais pas l'énumération",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "J'irai dans la puissance du Seigneur",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; je ferai mention de ta justice, de la tienne seule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu m'as enseigné dès ma jeunesse ; et jusqu'ici j'ai annoncé tes merveilles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et aussi, jusqu'à la vieillesse et aux cheveux blancs, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! ne m'abandonne pas, jusqu'à ce que j'annonce ton bras à [cette] génération, ta puissance à tous ceux qui viendront.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et ta justice, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! est haut élevée",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Toi qui as fait de grandes choses, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.71.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! qui est comme toi ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 71:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toi qui nous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "as fait voir de nombreuses et amères détresses, tu nous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "redonneras la vie, et tu nous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "feras remonter hors des profondeurs de la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.71.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.71.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
